    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Roopta haw",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwayeesha NG'UTAMIIDA Nuhu, “Una jeeda maleambooda, ang'iing'i sea fugeaba gheang'u, aba gideaba naadaayi gideaba guwoosi doabiiwaat aba madeedeanyu aba jeedeaba seaygeani bea ghamneawean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geanda diyean iyeenya niba ispwa, miyaasiin was jurukta ea gheamata; ea diyeanga mii miyaasiin nung' gabadiina iyeenya, jurukta ea gheamata; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ea dariidaw damanang'wan bea humng'eeda badiina iyeenya, jurukta ea gheamata, ak ghaghu heeluutka nyaawa aba badayda ng'eanyiisean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba iing'ata askwearjooji ispwa gaydanung' ghwahidu roopta badayda ng'eanyiida askwearjooji haradam eawa ea askweari; ak abeeda gilinyoo gwandeawa eaweega gaydageandeawa badayda ng'eanyiida.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin Nuhu ng'asheega sean rukusa NG'UTAMIIDA.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Nuhu gaba gweanyeew bughalaji lah damanda roabwana roopta haw bea guldeayda aba badayda ng'eanyiida. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawa Nuhu jeeda maleambooda sea orjoagaaschi ea gadeemga orjoagaaschi, nea gamng'awa guldeayda roopta haw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ea diyeanga miyaas, ea diyeanga mii miyaas, ea dariidaka, ea gili wasean badiina jeeda aba ng'eanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gabadiina iyeenya iyeenya, jurukta ea gheamata ak goodeayi sea Nuhu jeeda maleambooda, gawuurji gidarukusiinda ASEETA Nuhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata eawooji ispwa ghwaroabwan roopta haw aba badayda ng'eanyiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iimuchu nea gaba Nuhu gweanyeew bughalaji lah, sheedeaba iyeenya, nea askwearjeandeaba damanispwa bea sheeda gil, gwasim geat beega mida uuta ng'eanyiida ak ghwajaada seawuutka humng'eeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ghwaroabwan aba badayda ng'eanyiida askwearjooji haradam eawa ea askweari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eaweedida gawa Nuhu jeeda maleambooda sea orjoagaaschi Shemu ea Hamu ea Yafet, ea gatmooda Nuhu ea gadeem samwagu bea orjoagaaschi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gaweay saawa jeeda maleambooda sea giliwas diyeayda aba heeluutka nyaawa, ea dugwa sean aba heeluutka nyaawa, ea diyeanga badiina jeesinga aba badayda ng'eanyiida aba heeluutka nyaawa, ea giliwas dariideanda aba heeluutka nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goodeayi sean sea Nuhu jeeda maleambooda, gabadiina iyeenya iyeenya gilinyoo gwandeawa eaweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gaweay jeeda maleambooda, gilinyoo ea diyeayda gawuurji gidarukusiinda ASEETA niny; ng'ata ghwajap NG'UTAMIIDA gidaghuuta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwaroabwan askwearjooji haradam aba badayda ng'eanyiida; ghoahaada beega, ea gagatkat maleambooda, ea gwaheeli ng'eanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwaheedu uurda beega aba seang'ayda aba badayda ng'eanyiida; ak gwaneayi maleambooda aba badayda beega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghwasaang'ayiit beega muuchi aba badayda ng'eanyiida ea gwadukuta giijeega geawi mida jeeda ng'eanyiida; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ghwasaang'ayiit beega dukuta giijeega, ea gageanu geatin damanamuut aba geawunda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak goosha diyeanga sean weelweel aba badayda ng'eanyiida, dariidaka, ea dugwa, ea diyeanga, ea hawanyoojiga diyeanga sean mida badayda ng'eanyiida, ea buuneesean; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gameewa diyeanga sean gisa jeameeda sareenuuka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwaduulu gilinyoo gwandeawa eaweega mida badayda ng'eanyiida, buuneeda ea diyeanga ea diyeanga badiina jeesinga ea dariidaka humng'eeda; geeduulu sean aba badayda ng'eanyiida. Ak geapuut Nuhu ak ghwahit, sea fugiga mideayeesa jeeda maleamboodean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 7:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean goobiida beega badayda ng'eanyiida eawooji bughala ea haradam ea damanamughuush.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.7.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.7.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
